j+k] = (g0[i+1][j+k] + (g0[i][j] * f[k] + f0[i][j] * g[k]) % mo * comb) % mo\n\n    ans = 0\n    for i in range(1, m + 1):\n        if n + 1 - m - i >= 0:\n            # P(n+1-m-i, i+1) = C[(n+1-m-i) + (i+1) - 1][(i+1)-1] = C[n+1-m][i]\n            # Actually P(a,b) = C[a+b-1][b-1]\n            # Here a = n+1-m-i, b = i+1 => C[(n+1-m-i)+(i+1)-1][(i+1)-1] = C[n+1-m][i]\n            # But we can compute directly using C array\n            # C[n+1-m][i] is defined if n+1-m <= maxn\n            ans = (ans + g0[i][m] * C[n+1-m][i]) % mo\n    print(ans)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    main()\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.98\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-0.00035315475543029606, -7.986990567587782e-06, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.0001668790791882202, -0.00011252723925281316, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.005242766346782446, -0.004132423084229231, -0.423869252204895, -0.00026174934464506805, -6.079655122448457e-06, -0.004760123789310455, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.00012861855793744326, 0.0, -0.006719138007611036, -1.7881377516459906e-06, -0.038041986525058746, -7.867782187531702e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -1.3828182090946939e-05, -0.00015853578224778175, 0.0, -0.0011701886542141438, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.029773790389299393, -0.6931929588317871, -7.867782187531702e-06, -4.768370445162873e-07, -0.0007500219508074224, -3.576278118089249e-07, -8.106198947643861e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.0036485311575233936, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.12695010006427765, -0.038044169545173645, -0.006813625805079937, -0.02485167793929577, -2.1219027985353023e-05, -0.06580567359924316, -2.4676019165781327e-05, -0.039076123386621475, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.31336143612861633, -0.4801185727119446, -2.169585604860913e-05, -0.017573952674865723, -0.0002053765201708302, -0.816627025604248, -0.22770704329013824, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.007055368740111589, -